 "version": 1,
 "html": "<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <nav aria-label=\"Sections\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">CamilaNika <span>API</span></div>\n    <label for=\"q\" class=\"navlbl\">Filter endpoints</label>\n    <input id=\"q\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"e.g. voucher, stock, orders\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <div class=\"navlbl\">Basics</div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"#overview\">Overview</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#auth\">Authentication</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#enums\">Enums &amp; values</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"navlbl\">Endpoints</div>\n    <ul id=\"toc\"></ul>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main>\n    <header id=\"overview\">\n      <h1>CamilaNika API Reference</h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Every backend call made by the storefront (<code>index.html</code> → <code>js/shop.js</code>) and the admin panel (<code>admin.html</code>, <code>js/cashflow.js</code>). The backend is a Supabase project: PostgREST tables, Postgres RPC functions, three Edge Functions and two Storage buckets.</p>\n      <div class=\"meta\" id=\"stats\"></div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"note\">\n      <b>How this was built.</b> Documented on 8 Nov 2026 from the shipped front-end code and checked against the live database schema. Signatures, return types and enum values come from Postgres (<code>pg_proc</code> and check constraints). Every RPC is <code>SECURITY DEFINER</code>; admin RPCs are executable by any signed-in user and check the admin role inside the function. Internal helper functions (triggers, loyalty, voucher logging and similar) can't be called through the API and are left out.\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"note\">\n      <b>Note.</b> Promotions use <code>free_item</code> as a discount type, while vouchers, tiers and campaigns use <code>shipping</code>.\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Base URLs</h2>\n      <div class=\"tblw\"><table>\n        <thead><tr><th>Surface</th><th>URL</th><th>Client call</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Tables (PostgREST)</td><td><code>https://&lt;project-ref&gt;.supabase.co/rest/v1/&lt;table&gt;</code></td><td><code>sb.from(\"table\")</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>RPC functions</td><td><code>https://&lt;project-ref&gt;.supabase.co/rest/v1/rpc/&lt;fn&gt;</code></td><td><code>sb.rpc(\"fn\", args)</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Edge Functions</td><td><code>https://&lt;project-ref&gt;.supabase.co/functions/v1/&lt;name&gt;</code></td><td><code>fetch(…)</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Storage</td><td><code>https://&lt;project-ref&gt;.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/…</code></td><td><code>sb.storage.from(\"bucket\")</code></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table></div>\n      <p class=\"lede\">The project URL and anon key come from <code>js/config.js</code> (<code>SUPABASE_URL</code>, <code>SUPABASE_ANON_KEY</code>). Other config keys: <code>ONLINE_PAYMENT</code>, <code>WHATSAPP</code>, <code>SITE_URL</code>.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"auth\">\n      <h2>Authentication</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div class=\"box\"><span class=\"auth a-public\">Public</span><p>Anon key only. Send <code>apikey</code> and <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;anon key&gt;</code>.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"box\"><span class=\"auth a-customer\">Customer</span><p>Signed-in shopper. <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;user access_token&gt;</code>. Row-level security scopes data to the user.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"box\"><span class=\"auth a-admin\">Admin</span><p>Signed-in user whose <code>profiles.role</code> is <code>admin</code>. Same headers as Customer; the RPCs and policies check the role.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Login is phone-based. <code>phone-signup</code> returns a synthetic <code>login</code> email, which the client passes to <code>auth.signInWithPassword({ email, password })</code>. Edge Functions are called with the anon key as Bearer and the user's JWT in a separate <code>x-user-token</code> header.</p>\n      <div class=\"codewrap\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">Copy</button><pre>curl -X POST \"https://&lt;project-ref&gt;.supabase.co/rest/v1/rpc/admin_set_order_status\" \\\n  -H \"apikey: $ANON_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $USER_ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"p_order_id\": \"&lt;order-id&gt;\", \"p_status\": \"processing\"}'</pre></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"enums\">\n      <h2>Enums &amp; values</h2>\n      <div class=\"tblw\"><table>\n        <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Values</th><th>Used by</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody id=\"enum-body\"></tbody>\n      </table></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span><span class=\"verb v-GET\">GET</span> read</span>\n      <span><span class=\"verb v-POST\">POST</span> RPC / insert / function</span>\n      <span><span class=\"verb v-PATCH\">PATCH</span> update</span>\n      <span><span class=\"verb v-DELETE\">DELETE</span> delete</span>\n      <span><span class=\"verb v-STORAGE\">FILE</span> storage</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"groups\"></div>\n    <p class=\"empty\" id=\"empty\" hidden>No endpoints match that filter.</p>\n  </main>\n</div>",
