   "id": "checkout",
   "name": "Checkout & signup",
   "blurb": "Edge Functions. Send anon key as Bearer, user JWT (if any) as x-user-token.",
   "eps": [
    [
     "POST",
     "functions/v1/create-payment",
     "public",
     "Create order & payment",
     "Creates the order and starts payment. Works for guests; pass x-user-token to attach it to the account. First checks shop_settings.online_payment (off / test = admins only / on) and the checkout limits: 403 ONLINE_PAYMENT_OFF, 429 RATE_LIMITED (per network) or 429 TOO_MANY_PENDING (unpaid orders per phone). Response includes order_number, access_token and a free flag for zero-total orders; errors come back as { error, detail } (e.g. PAYMENT_GATEWAY_ERROR).",
     null,
     "{\n  \"items\": [ { \"variant_id\": 12, \"quantity\": 2, \"addon\": false, \"choices\": {} } ],\n  \"promo_code\": \"HEMAT10\",          // or null\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"name\": \"Siti\", \"phone\": \"081234567890\", \"email\": \"\",\n    \"address\": \"Jl. ...\", \"lat\": -6.54, \"lng\": 106.78\n  }\n}"
    ],
    [
     "POST",
